@startuml HLRQ-16-sdr-decomposition
' Dekompozicija SDR sposobnosti — što je dijeljeno, a što specijalizirano.
' Gledište: struktura. Publika: arhitekt, implementator.
' Prikaz, ne izvor istine (D-13) — izvor su HLRQ-16 §4a–§4b, NFRQ-ORG-08 i kod
' blackwattle connections/sdr/, drivers/sdr.py, processors/sdr.py (usklađeno 2026-09-11).
' Imena konekcije, drivera i procesora po konvenciji NFRQ-ORG-02 (autor, 2026-09-11);
' ostala imena su provizorna. Prijam, odašiljanje i sken razdvajaju se u sloju konekcije
' (autor, 2026-09-11): procesora po smjeru nema.
' Prilagodnik obitelji je helper bez temeljne klase primitiva (NFRQ-ORG-04).
title HLRQ-16 SDR — shared contract, one backend per family, one profile per model

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "wattleflow-workflow · concrete/ (zero-trust)" #F4F4F4 {
  abstract class GenericConnection
  abstract class GenericDriver
  abstract class GenericProcessor
  abstract class GenericParser
}

package "blackwattle · connections/sdr/" #FFF8E1 {
  class SDRConnection
  abstract class SDRBackend <<helper>>
  class RTLSDRBackend <<helper>>
  class HackRFBackend <<phase 2>>
}

package "blackwattle · drivers/sdr.py" #FFF8E1 {
  class DriverSDR
  class IQSampleParser <<helper>>
}

package "blackwattle · processors/sdr.py" #FFF8E1 {
  class SDRReadProcessor
}

package "configuration · values, not code" #E3F2FD {
  class SDRProfile <<value>>
  class SDRInstance <<value>>
  class SDRTuningPlan <<value>>
}

GenericConnection <|-- SDRConnection
GenericDriver <|-- DriverSDR
GenericProcessor <|-- SDRReadProcessor
GenericParser <|-- IQSampleParser
SDRBackend <|-- RTLSDRBackend
SDRBackend <|-- HackRFBackend

SDRReadProcessor --> DriverSDR : driver
DriverSDR --> SDRConnection : connection_manager\n+ connection_name
DriverSDR ..> IQSampleParser : bytes → samples
SDRConnection --> SDRBackend : one per family\n(host library)
SDRConnection --> SDRProfile : declared capabilities
SDRConnection --> SDRInstance : unit and task
SDRInstance --> SDRTuningPlan : optional (scan)

note as N1 #FFCDD2
  <b>No class per vendor or model.</b>
  New model = new profile (configuration).
  New family = new backend helper.
  New contract (full duplex, coherent
  channels) = contract extension.
end note
N1 .. SDRBackend

note as N2
  <b>No processor per direction.</b> Receive, transmit
  and scan are state of the connection layer.
  Transmit reaches the unit through a repository
  whose write strategy calls DriverSDR.write —
  refused by type until a family transmits.
end note
N2 .. SDRConnection
@enduml
